| **Fine‑grained IAM** | The EC2/ECS task role (or Kubernetes service account) can be limited to read only the specific secret ARN. |
| **Automatic rotation** | When the secret value changes in AWS, the next container restart picks up the new value without code changes. |
| **Auditability** | Access to secrets is logged by AWS, giving you a trace of who/what fetched them. |

