> **Why:**  
> - `helmet` sets a bundle of security‑related HTTP headers.  
> - `cors` allows you to lock down which origins may call your API.  
> - `express-rate-limit` mitigates brute‑force and DoS attacks.  
> - `morgan` (or Winston) provides request logging.  
